   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• “law” named “Act” → statute, full name + wiki title\n• “section” + number 34 → provision “section 34”, linked to it\n• “government-organization” → court, named “Delhi High Court”\n• “award-01” (the act of awarding) → “award” (the thing)\n• “under” → the legal link “prep-under”\n• kept as it was: the root “challenge”, the court, July 2013",
   "originalText": "• “law” named “Act” → statute, full name + wiki title\n• “section” + number 34 → provision “section 34”, linked to it\n• “government-organization” → court, named “Delhi High Court”\n• “award-01” (the act of awarding) → “award” (the thing)\n• “under” → the legal link “prep-under”\n• kept as it was: the root “challenge”, the court, July 2013",
