   "text": ":legal-name  the full name, kept exactly as written  ·  \"Companies Act, 2013\"\n:legal-level  what kind of provision  ·  section, article, clause, sub-section, schedule, chapter, part\n:legal-type  what kind of body  ·  ministry, department, court, tribunal, statutory-body, state-government, local-authority\n:legal-year  the year in the name  ·  2013\n:legal-jurisdiction  where it applies  ·  \"India\", \"State of Kerala\"\n:legal-citation  the case citation  ·  \"AIR 1973 SC 1461\"\n:legal-status  in-force, repealed, struck-down, amended, not-yet-in-force\n:legal-valid-from / :legal-valid-until  the dates it is in force  ·  \"2024-07-01\" / \"2024-06-30\"\n:legal-enacted-on  the date it was enacted  ·  \"1860-10-06\"\n:legal-notified-on  the date a notification was published  ·  \"2014-03-27\"\noptional  :legal-weight  how strong a citation is  ·  binding, persuasive, obiter",
