   "index": "b32B045",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1617349552,
   "version": 62,
   "versionNonce": 323946140,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795171947188,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "R1 Sentence: \"In Ssangyong … v. National Highways Authority of India, (2019) 15 SCC 131, the Supreme Court of India held…\" → SPRING: hold-02 +\n\"Supreme Court\". Lost: the parties, the case name, the citation and \"of India\" — nothing says which judgment this is.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "R1 Sentence: \"In Ssangyong … v. National Highways Authority of India, (2019) 15 SCC 131, the Supreme Court of India held…\" → SPRING: hold-02 +\n\"Supreme Court\". Lost: the parties, the case name, the citation and \"of India\" — nothing says which judgment this is.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprWrongNote2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 6916,
   "y": 2101.5,
   "width": 1007.72,
   "height": 41.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B046",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2007553972,
   "version": 62,
   "versionNonce": 847877000,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795171947188,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "R2 Sentence: \"the scope of judicial interference in arbitral awards\". → SPRING: scope :mod interfere-01, with \"judiciary\" invented as the doer and\n\"award-01\" (the act of awarding) as the target. Lost: \"judicial\" modifies interference, no \"judiciary\" is named, and awards are decisions, not\nawarding.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "R2 Sentence: \"the scope of judicial interference in arbitral awards\". → SPRING: scope :mod interfere-01, with \"judiciary\" invented as the doer and\n\"award-01\" (the act of awarding) as the target. Lost: \"judicial\" modifies interference, no \"judiciary\" is named, and awards are decisions, not\nawarding.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprWrongNote3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 6916,
   "y": 2152.75,
   "width": 1000.9,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B047",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 773344341,
   "version": 215,
   "versionNonce": 1397871145,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795171947188,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "R3 Sentence: \"Section 34 of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\" and \"Section 34(2)\". → SPRING: section 34; the Act name has no 1996 (1996\nbecomes a :time on the section); \"(2)\" disappears. Lost: the exact sub-section that lists the grounds, and the year/identity of the Act.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "R3 Sentence: \"Section 34 of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\" and \"Section 34(2)\". → SPRING: section 34; the Act name has no 1996 (1996\nbecomes a :time on the section); \"(2)\" disappears. Lost: the exact sub-section that lists the grounds, and the year/identity of the Act.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "HOmmQ8CIujO1ASaddWg3m",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 6908.394764956527,
   "y": 868.8380952380946,
   "width": 2043.5648148148157,
   "height": 183.96968149222636,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
   "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
   "strokeWidth": 4,
   "strokeStyle": "dotted",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b2U046A006G",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 654696951,
   "version": 253,
   "versionNonce": 938234530,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173176573,
   "created": 1795105328513,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "In Ssangyong Engineering & Construction Co. Ltd. v. National Highways Authority of India, (2019) 15 SCC 131, \nthe Supreme Court of India held that, following the Arbitration and Conciliation (Amendment) Act, 2015 which\namended Section 34 of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996, the scope of judicial interference in arbitral\nawards is restricted to the grounds enumerated in Section 34(2) and does not extend to re-appreciation of\nevidence.",
   "fontSize": 30.66161358203773,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "In Ssangyong Engineering & Construction Co. Ltd. v. National Highways Authority of India, (2019) 15 SCC 131, \nthe Supreme Court of India held that, following the Arbitration and Conciliation (Amendment) Act, 2015 which amended Section 34 of the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996, the scope of judicial interference in arbitral awards is restricted to the grounds enumerated in Section 34(2) and does not extend to re-appreciation of evidence.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprWrongHeader",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 6916,
   "y": 2038,
   "width": 449.1,
   "height": 18.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
