  {
   "id": "SprRightNote1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8030,
   "y": 2064,
   "width": 966.8,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B052",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1948410802,
   "version": 75,
   "versionNonce": 1763673107,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795172619082,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "G1 AGENT: \"Supreme Court of India\" as a court, and a judgment node holding \"Ssangyong … v. NHAI\" plus \"(2019) 15 SCC 131\" — the identity and\ncitation SPRING dropped.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G1 AGENT: \"Supreme Court of India\" as a court, and a judgment node holding \"Ssangyong … v. NHAI\" plus \"(2019) 15 SCC 131\" — the identity and\ncitation SPRING dropped.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprRightNote2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8030,
   "y": 2101.5,
   "width": 1000.9,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B053",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 861975156,
   "version": 75,
   "versionNonce": 1150797846,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795172619082,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "G2 AGENT: \"Section 34\" as a provision inside \"Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\", with 1996 as the Act's year — the year is back on the Act,\nnot a time of the section.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G2 AGENT: \"Section 34\" as a provision inside \"Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\", with 1996 as the Act's year — the year is back on the Act,\nnot a time of the section.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprRightNote3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8030,
   "y": 2139,
   "width": 973.62,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B054",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 676061217,
   "version": 76,
   "versionNonce": 202142729,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173670339,
   "created": 1795172619082,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "G3 AGENT: restrict-01 takes interfere-01, with the court as the one interfering (ARG0) and \"award\" (the decision) as its object — no invented\n\"judiciary\", no act-of-awarding.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G3 AGENT: restrict-01 takes interfere-01, with the court as the one interfering (ARG0) and \"award\" (the decision) as its object — no invented\n\"judiciary\", no act-of-awarding.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprRightNote4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8030,
   "y": 2176.5,
   "width": 884.96,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B055",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1481414120,
   "version": 76,
   "versionNonce": 486847130,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173677879,
   "created": 1795172619082,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "G4 AGENT: \"(2)\" is restored as \"Section 34(2)\", a sub-section of the same Act — the exact provision that enumerates the grounds.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G4 AGENT: \"(2)\" is restored as \"Section 34(2)\", a sub-section of the same Act — the exact provision that enumerates the grounds.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
  {
   "id": "SprRightNote5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 8030,
   "y": 2200.25,
   "width": 946.34,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b32B056",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 791552188,
   "version": 77,
   "versionNonce": 795453427,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795173677879,
   "created": 1795172619082,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "section": "lean-amr-v11"
   },
   "text": "G5 AGENT: \"does not extend to re-appreciation of evidence\" keeps the negation and makes evidence a thing; it still says \"appreciate\", not\n\"re-appreciation\", so the legal term is only approximated.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G5 AGENT: \"does not extend to re-appreciation of evidence\" keeps the negation and makes evidence a thing; it still says \"appreciate\", not\n\"re-appreciation\", so the legal term is only approximated.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
